{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105166","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105166/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105166/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105166/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105166","id":2981011234,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6R2l02","number":105166,"title":"Change `get_class_static` to return `StringName`.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-04-08T21:39:50Z","updated_at":"2025-04-09T14:07:48Z","closed_at":"2025-04-09T14:06:20Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105166","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105166","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105166.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105166.patch","merged_at":"2025-04-09T14:06:20Z"},"body":"Follow-up of #105099.\r\n\r\n`get_class_static` currently returns a newly allocated `String`. Instead, I propose to make it return `StringName`, using the same mechanic previously used for `_get_class_namev`.\r\nMost callers use it as `StringName` anyway, making it a better match.\r\n\r\nThis substantially improves performance of `get_class_static` callers:\r\n- Those that use it as `String` no longer need to allocate a new string; instead they can use a `CoW` copy of the `StringName`'s buffer.\r\n- Those that expect `StringName` no longer need to allocate `String`, and no longer need to search for the `StringName` in the `StringName` table.\r\n\r\nThis PR also seems to reduce the binary size by a whopping 4mb (2%) for me. This is possibly because `get_class_static` was using `_FORCE_INLINE_` before, although i'm still surprised it had that much of a size impact.\r\n\r\n## Benchmark\r\n\r\n`get_class_static` did not appear in profiles earlier, so I don't expect any measurable changes. Just to be sure, I benchmarked. It was an unsubstantial 1% improvement (within expected error):\r\n\r\n```\r\n ❯ hyperfine -m25 -iw1 \"bin/godot.macos.editor.arm64.master --path /Users/lukas/dev/godot/empty-game --editor --quit\" \"bin/godot.macos.editor.arm64 --path /Users/lukas/dev/godot/empty-game --editor --quit\"\r\nBenchmark 1: bin/godot.macos.editor.arm64.master --path /Users/lukas/dev/godot/empty-game --editor --quit\r\n  Time (mean ± σ):      3.469 s ±  0.142 s    [User: 2.466 s, System: 0.335 s]\r\n  Range (min … max):    3.213 s …  3.753 s    25 runs\r\n\r\nBenchmark 2: bin/godot.macos.editor.arm64 --path /Users/lukas/dev/godot/empty-game --editor --quit\r\n  Time (mean ± σ):      3.427 s ±  0.114 s    [User: 2.449 s, System: 0.332 s]\r\n  Range (min … max):    3.232 s …  3.592 s    25 runs\r\n\r\nSummary\r\n  bin/godot.macos.editor.arm64 --path /Users/lukas/dev/godot/empty-game --editor --quit ran\r\n    1.01 ± 0.05 times faster than bin/godot.macos.editor.arm64.master --path /Users/lukas/dev/godot/empty-game --editor --quit\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105166/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105166/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}